   $q$According to the passage, how does a sundial show the time?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Water drips out and the level falls past lines.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-details"},{"text":"A candle burns down past lines along its side.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-details"},{"text":"A shadow moves with the sun and points to marks.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Gears and weights turn hands around a face.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-details"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$A shadow moves with the sun and points to marks.$q$, $q$Paragraph 2 says the shadow moves as the sun moves, "pointing to marks on the face." Dripping water describes a water clock, a different tool.$q$, 'draft', '93912662-8468-5a0e-8e1f-819ac3868486')
