   $q$In paragraph 4, "the machine woke up with a cheerful hum." What does this personification describe?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The machine had been asleep in bed in the spare room.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"literal-reading"},{"text":"The machine started running and made a pleasant, steady sound.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Grandma Ines started humming a song while she sewed.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-characters"},{"text":"The machine broke and made a loud, unhappy noise.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"opposite-meaning"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$The machine started running and made a pleasant, steady sound.$q$, $q$The machine "woke up" when Grandma pressed the pedal, so it started working, and "cheerful hum" describes its pleasant sound. Grandma is not described humming; the hum comes from the machine.$q$, 'draft', '338e4de6-03eb-59ed-98b0-cf3e3bb871b0')
