insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('b30167b8-e836-5642-a884-a4c4479be157', 'rg6-word-parts-p03', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g6-word-parts'), null,
        '6-8', $q$Sunday Calls$q$, $q$Every Sunday, Priya Raman set up the family tablet on the kitchen table. Her grandmother lived in a small town across the ocean, and Sunday was their time to talk. The video call was the closest thing to a visit.

This week, Priya had a plan. Her grandmother had once been a science teacher, and Priya wanted to show her a project. Priya had used a microscope at school to look at onion skin, and she had drawn what she saw.

When the call connected, her grandmother's face filled the screen. "I can hear you, but your picture is frozen," Grandma said. Priya moved the tablet closer to the router, and soon the picture was clear again.

Priya held her drawing up to the camera. The tiny cells looked like rows of bricks. Grandma leaned close to her own screen. "Those cells are invisible without help," she said, "but your drawing makes them easy to see."

Then Grandma surprised her. She held up an old telescope she had kept since college. She promised to show Priya the craters on the moon through it the next time Priya came to stay.

After the call, Priya's little brother asked why Grandma always seemed so happy on Sundays. Priya thought about it. Even with thousands of miles between them, the screen made the distance feel small.$q$, 'draft')
