   $q$What makes the volcano study a fair comparison of the two study methods?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Each group was taught by a different teacher at a different school.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"Both groups read the same article and took the same test one week later.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The self-quiz group was allowed to look at the article while writing.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"The rereading group had already studied volcanoes in an earlier class.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Both groups read the same article and took the same test one week later.$q$, $q$Because the article, the test and the waiting time were the same, the main difference between the groups was how they studied. The self-quiz group "closed the article," so they did not look at it.$q$, 'draft', '7b3d51ac-2729-566d-8092-73d5770ad2eb')
